    "exercise.sounds": "Cac van. 'columns' = danh sach cot; moi cot gom cac 'groups' (tone = yellow|pink|blue|violet); moi group gom cac 'rows'; o dau moi hang la nguyen am, cac o sau la am tiet. Hang ngan hon 3 o thi de trong.",
